{
  "title": "Kicked Peppery Filipino King Prawns Skewers",
  "description": "A peppery and crispy Filipino dish featuring king prawns, this recipe is perfect for those looking for a flavorful and energizing meal. It is also Buddhist-temple-friendly and uses a salt block as the cooking vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Filipino",
  "diet": [
